{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119677","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119677/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119677/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119677/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119677","id":4506015739,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7eg_su","number":119677,"title":"Check PhysicsDirectBodyState sleep state before running _integrate_forces","user":{"login":"M-Boyo","id":115986902,"node_id":"U_kgDOBunR1g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115986902?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Boyo","html_url":"https://github.com/M-Boyo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Boyo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Boyo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Boyo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Boyo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Boyo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Boyo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Boyo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Boyo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M-Boyo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-22T23:01:18Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T05:47:42Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119677","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119677","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119677.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119677.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #108656 \r\n\r\nWhat happens is that the RigidBody sleeps and wake up indefinitely.\r\nThe bug appears when a value under the sleep threshold is assigned to `linear/angular_velocity` properties in `_integrate_forces`, and that the PhysicsDirectBodyState has been still for long enough.\r\n\r\n0) At the end of the previous physics step, the PhysicsDirectBodyState is put to sleep\r\n1) Next physics step : its associated RigidBody is put to sleep too in the `_body_state_changed` function\r\n2) Still in `_body_state_changed`, an assignation to `linear_velocity` or `angular_velocity` in `_integrate_forces` wakes up the PhysicsDirectBodyState and then the RigidBody\r\n3) Since it's now awake, the RigidBody is added to `state_query_list`, so `_body_state_changed` will be called next frame\r\n4) The PhysicsDirectBodyState is put to sleep again and the cycle keeps going to infinity!\r\n\r\nMy solution is to call `_integrate_forces` only if the PhysicsDirectBodyState is awake. This function is not supposed to be called if the RigidBody is asleep.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119677/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119677/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}